 "excerpt": "Conferences, trainings, webinars and launches that matter to Bangladesh's development sector, with the latest coverage of each. Lead event · 9 to 20 November COP31 opens in Antalya: what is at stake for Bangladesh The 31st UN Climate Change Conference (COP31) runs from 9 to 20 November 2026 in Antalya, Türkiye. Türkiye hosts the conference [...]",
 "content": "\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.49), 19px);line-height:1.55\">Conferences, trainings, webinars and launches that matter to Bangladesh&#8217;s development sector, with the latest coverage of each.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-background wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"border-radius:999px;color:#0e1116;background-color:#12b886;margin-bottom:12px;padding-top:5px;padding-right:12px;padding-bottom:5px;padding-left:12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;display:inline-block\">Lead event · 9 to 20 November</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-1\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:clamp(23.043px, 1.44rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 1.466), 38px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\">COP31 opens in Antalya: what is at stake for Bangladesh</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.392), 18px);line-height:1.55\">The 31st UN Climate Change Conference (COP31) runs from 9 to 20 November 2026 in Antalya, Türkiye. Türkiye hosts the conference and works in partnership with Australia on the negotiations, according to the <a href=\"https://unric.org/en/unfccc-cop31-the-road-to-antalya/\">UN Regional Information Centre</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.392), 18px);line-height:1.55\">For Bangladesh, the talks come as the government tries to turn climate plans into funded projects. At a Dhaka conference in October, Environment Minister Abdul Awal Mintoo called for climate justice on loss and damage and for more private investment in clean energy (<a href=\"/2026/10/29/dhaka-climate-partnership-conference-launches-project-tracking-portal/\">our report</a>). A BRAC University study released on 17 October puts the cost of the country&#8217;s health adaptation plan alone at about US$1.4 billion over five years, with US$520 million expected from development partners (<a href=\"/2026/10/29/climate-health-plan-needs-1-4-billion-over-five-years-study-finds/\">our report</a>).</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.392), 18px);line-height:1.55\"><strong>What to watch:</strong> new climate finance pledges and how much reaches adaptation and loss and damage, how least developed and climate-vulnerable countries are represented in the final decisions, and any announcements on funding for Bangladesh.</p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:24px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-2\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(17.905px, 1.119rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.99), 28px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\">Coming up</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>9 to 10 Nov</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0b8f68;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Conference · Dhaka</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-3\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"https://cpd.org.bd/cpd-climate-week-2026/\">CPD Climate Week 2026</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">The Centre for Policy Dialogue&#8217;s conference for early career climate researchers. Dates are tentative; the call for papers has closed. Check with CPD about attending.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>Apply by 15 Nov</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0b8f68;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Training</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-4\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"https://safeguardingsupporthub.org/location/bangladesh\">Leading Safeguarding programme for senior CSO staff</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">RSH Bangladesh&#8217;s advanced safeguarding programme, about five months long, for civil society organisations in Bangladesh. Listed from a single secondary source: confirm with RSH.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>15 Nov</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#c2410c;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Funding deadline</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-5\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"https://www.undp.org/press-releases/innovators-wanted-undp-launches-usd-1-million-global-challenge-healthier-ocean\">UNDP Ocean Innovation Challenge closes</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">Up to US$100,000 each for up to 10 innovators working on marine pollution, coastal restoration and the blue economy. Solutions that benefit Bangladesh get priority.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:24px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>16 Nov</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#c2410c;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Funding deadline</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-5\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"/2026/10/29/open-call-global-eba-fund-medium-size-grants-of-up-to-500000-for-ecosystem-based-adaptation/\">Global EbA Fund medium-size grants close</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">Grants of up to US$500,000 for ecosystem-based adaptation projects in ODA-eligible countries, including Bangladesh.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:24px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>30 Nov</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#c2410c;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Award deadline</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-5\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"https://www.yves-rocher-fondation.org/en/how-to-apply-for-the-international-award/\">Terre de Femmes International Award 2027 closes</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">Two awards of EUR 10,000 for urban tree projects led by women and run through a non-profit. Open worldwide.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:24px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-6\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(17.905px, 1.119rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.99), 28px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\">Recent events</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>29 Oct</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#5b3a8c;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Study launch · Dhaka</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-7\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"/2026/10/30/climate-related-health-risks-cost-bangladesh-20-7-billion-a-year/\">Climate-related health risks cost Bangladesh $20.7 billion a year</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">The Knowledge Hub Institute launched its study on the health costs of climate change at the BRAC Centre.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>17 Oct</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#5b3a8c;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Study launch · Dhaka</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-8\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"/2026/10/29/climate-health-plan-needs-1-4-billion-over-five-years-study-finds/\">Climate-health plan needs $1.4 billion over five years</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">BRAC University&#8217;s C3ER released its financing study for the Health National Adaptation Plan 2026-2031 at the BRAC Centre.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>October</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#5b3a8c;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Conference · Dhaka</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-9\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"/2026/10/29/dhaka-climate-partnership-conference-launches-project-tracking-portal/\">Climate partnership conference launches project-tracking portal</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">The Bangladesh Climate Development Partnership Knowledge Conference 2026, held with ADB support, drew more than 500 participants.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-4f94ede8 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"border-bottom-color:#e7e7e1;border-bottom-width:1px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:18px;padding-bottom:18px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:120px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.3\"><strong>July</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#5b3a8c;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3\">Report launch · Dhaka</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-10\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\"><a href=\"/2026/10/29/only-30-of-secondary-teachers-trained-in-health-education-study-finds/\">Only 30% of secondary teachers trained in health education</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.55\">The Directorate of Secondary and Higher Education presented its school health study, supported by UNESCO, to about 120 stakeholders.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:24px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-radius:20px;background-color:#f4f4ef;padding-top:28px;padding-right:28px;padding-bottom:28px;padding-left:28px\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-link-color wp-elements-11\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:clamp(15.747px, 0.984rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.809), 24px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.03em;line-height:1.1\">Running an event?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.196), 16px);line-height:1.55\">List your conference, training, webinar or launch on Devlens for free. Devlens podcasts and webinars on sector issues are coming soon.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.196), 16px);line-height:1.55\">